IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-10`
IMPORT `P2-art-11`

-- P2-tests-versions.l4 (hand-written): the version pairs of Articles 10 and 11 side by side.
-- The Omnibus took effect on 27 July 2026; Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027 (Annex III route) at the earliest, so a dispatcher gated by Article 113 always reads the text as amended:
-- its as-enacted branch is dead. The text as enacted is therefore tested through its own function (no date, no gate), and the dispatcher is tested on both sides of the day the Section applies.
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text of each version (the base file for as enacted, the consolidated text for as amended).

`Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE

§ `Article 10(1): paragraph 5 (as enacted) against Article 4a(1) (as amended)`

-- Facts in order: the system trains models, data sets are used, the criteria of paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 are met, then (as enacted) the criteria of paragraph 5, (as amended) the criteria referred to in Article 4a(1).
-- Same facts, same answer where the two texts agree: every criterion met.
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The criteria of paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 unmet: both texts say no.
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The text changed here: as enacted the fourth fact is paragraph 5's criteria (unmet: no); as amended it is Article 4a(1)'s (unmet: no).
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The dispatcher (date asked, system, harmonisation facts, then tr, used, q1, q5, qa): the day before the Section applies, NOTHING; from 2 December 2027 the text as amended is read, so the paragraph 5 fact is ignored.
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Article 10(6): paragraphs 2 to 5 (as enacted) against paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 and Article 4a(1) (as amended)`

-- Facts in order: the system is developed without training techniques, the paragraph asked about (a number; 0 for Article 4a(1)), whether it is Article 4a(1), whether the data set is a testing data set.
-- Paragraph 2 and a testing data set: both texts apply it. Not a testing data set: both say it does not.
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as enacted the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 2 FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as amended the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 2 FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as enacted the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 2 FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as amended the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 2 FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Paragraph 5: in the text as enacted, in the list; in the text as amended, deleted (silent).
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as enacted the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 5 FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as amended the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 5 FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Article 4a(1): in the text as amended, in the list; in the text as enacted, not there.
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as enacted the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) as amended the paragraph applies to the data set` TRUE 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The dispatcher: the day before the Section applies NOTHING; from 2 December 2027 the text as amended.
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) the paragraph applies to the data set` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE 2 FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) the paragraph applies to the data set` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE 5 FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 10(6) the paragraph applies to the data set` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` TRUE 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 11(1), second subparagraph: SMEs (as enacted) against SMEs and SMCs (as amended)`

-- Facts in order: an SME, including a start-up; (as amended only) an SMC.
-- An SME: both texts give the liberty.
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- An SMC that is not an SME: the Omnibus added it. The text as enacted is silent on it; the text as amended gives the liberty.
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Neither: both texts are silent.
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The dispatcher: the day before the Section applies NOTHING; from 2 December 2027 the text as amended (an SMC is in).
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 versions test the Annex III system` `Art 10 versions test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 11(1), second subparagraph: the Commission's form (as enacted for small and microenterprises, as amended for SMEs and SMCs)`

-- The form established: both texts. Not established: both texts say the Commission shall establish it: no.
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the Commission has established a simplified technical documentation form targeted at the needs of small and microenterprises` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the Commission has established a simplified technical documentation form targeted at the needs of SMEs and SMCs` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the Commission has established a simplified technical documentation form targeted at the needs of small and microenterprises` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the Commission has established a simplified technical documentation form targeted at the needs of SMEs and SMCs` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
